WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,410
You put a high hat on yourself, shut up

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:05,410
Stop talking

3
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:06,730
I want to say

4
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,050
At the traffic light intersection

5
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,170
He watched my brother get killed by a monster.

6
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:11,650
A piece of useless trash

7
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,330
What qualifications do you have to steal a house from us?

8
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,310
I tell you

9
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:17,110
These balls of wool say that Potian is also ours. How dare you do it?

10
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,110
I'll go find Mr. Dugu and make the decision for me.

11
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,870
Do you really know Mr. Dugu?

12
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,700
He even alternated with me

13
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:32,300
Don't you want me to make the decision now?

14
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,580
Why did I decide to let you die?

15
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,700
you are not satisfied

16
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,220
You are Dugu Qiubai

17
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,650
Don't be such a boss

18
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:42,890
Boss, I was wrong

19
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:45,970
It’s me who hides my helplessness and is greedy

20
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,650
I shouldn't steal your supplies

21
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:49,330
But I was all instigated by him

22
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:50,370
He told me

23
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:52,090
Said there would be surprises following you

24
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,970
I really didn’t expect you to be the boss of Dugu

25
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:54,890
i was wrong

26
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,410
Please forgive me, little one
